  "bodyHash": "chj1z3Xxn+s=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。滿載愛心打造。支援 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的眾多活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">寵物命名是一個極簡且可設定的模組，能為可馴服的幼年動物賦予預先定義的名稱。狼、貓、馬、驢、騾和駱馬皆可命名（若在設定中啟用）。</span><br><br></p><p>模組內含超過 5000 個名稱，每當幼年動物生成時，會隨機選取其中一個。</p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum's RPG Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>_useFemaleNames</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設：true</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>_useMaleNames</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設：true</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>nameWolves</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設：true</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>nameCats</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設：true</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>nameHorses</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設：true</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>nameDonkeys</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設：true</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>nameMules</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設：true</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>nameLlamas</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設：true</span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>看到自然賦予幼年動物的名字，總是一份令人開心的驚喜：</strong><br></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/pet-names/a.webp\" alt=\"生成畫面\" width=\"698\" height=\"472\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可自由在任何模組包中使用此模組，只要下載檔案仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 平台即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於我無法在眾多分散的模組頁面中追蹤留言，因此已關閉留言功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請至&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 倉庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
